<h1>{{childFirstName}}'s trial class is booked</h1>
<p>Hi {{parentFirstName}}, thank you for booking a free coding trial with Codeyoung. {{mentorFirstName}} will be {{childFirstName}}'s mentor.</p>
<p class="when">{{when}}</p>
<p class="actions"><a class="button" href="{{joinUrl}}">Join the class</a></p>
<p>The classroom opens {{opensBefore}} before the start. Keep this email: the button above is your personal link.</p>
<p>Need a different time? <a href="{{manageUrl}}">View or change the booking</a>. You can reschedule until {{rescheduleCutoff}} before the class, or cancel any time before it starts.</p>
<p class="muted">We attached a calendar invite. Booking reference {{reference}}.</p>
